1 NAME Susanne Sophie Caroline Gustava /Blom/
2 GIVN Susanne Sophie Caroline Gustava
2 SURN Blom
2 _MARNM Kielland
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 MAR 1800
