1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married Herbert Johnston in Mannville Alberta Canada  One son  Lloyd Johnston ( Mar 8, 1927- July 8, 2011) born in Edmonton Alberta Canada  Lloyd was with the Royal Canadian Mounted Police, he rode with the Musical
2 CONC  Ride for many years including for the coronation of Queen Elizabeth in London England.  Lloyd and his wife Joy had five sons - David, Lorne, Kent, Ewen and Chris They lived in Salmon Arm, British Columbia, Canada
