1 NOTE Harry, Kristoffer and Ludvig Østebøvik were fishermen from Borgøy in Rogaland.  With their smack "Klara" they went to Åsenfjorden in Trøndelag, joining the herring fishery.  Making business with Karl Nordaune, they got to know his
2 CONC  daughters. Klara married Harry, Jensine married Kristoffer and Gudrun married Ludvig.  They all moved to Borgøy where they had to rely on the boat to reach the school and do errands.  Luck with the fishery made a good living.  Th
2 CONC e sisters saw each other almost every day.  Klara was clever at gardening, Jensine enjoyed handwork and Gudrun was fond of drawing and playing the accordion.
