1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bygdebok for Ølen III page 377 Åsbø, page 379 Åsbø.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Hans Asbe #59697831. He was born in Steensland, Finnas, Hordaland, Norway. His wife was Bertha Eingor. They had known children, Daniel, Thomas, Nellie & Henry. Also, middle initial would probably been "T" for Torreson, 
2 CONC the father's name being Torres. Mother was Herberg Hansdtr. 
2 CONT Information provided by Bobbie Knudsen
2 CONT
2 CONT The following information was gleaned from Iowa Gravestone Photo Project: See photo on that website. 
2 CONT Andrew & wife Enger emigrated from Rosendal area of Norway which is south of Bergen Norway in 1873.
2 CONT Parents of Daniel, Tollef, Anton, Tom,Louis, Henry, Nellie Asbe Walker and Christine Asbe Norwick (Gravestone project had last names of Nellie and Christine reversed.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders born 10 July 1854 on
2 CONT Aasbø, Fjelberg, Hordaland, Norway
2 CONT Baptised: 16 July 1854
2 CONT Parents: Toress Anfinsen and Herborg Hansdatter  ...farm Aasbø.
2 CONT
2 CONT Aasbø is spelling used in Oluf Rygh Farm Name Index in about 1900. Earlier it may have been Aasbøe
2 CONT
2 CONT (Courtesy of Scarlett Glover #46838574)
2 CONT
