1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.nermo.org/slekt/d0013/g0000017.html#I22076
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Christensdatter THRANE
2 CONT
2 CONT 1613 - 26 Oct 1684
2 CONT
2 CONT     * RESIDENCE: 18 barn
2 CONT
2 CONT     * BIRTH: 1613, Stavanger
2 CONT
2 CONT     * DEATH: 26 Oct 1684, Hana, Høyland, RO 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 18 barn med Søfren Peders. Godtzen
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth giftet seg med Søfren Peders. Godtzen den 10 Jan 1630 i Stavanger. (Søfren Peders. Godtzen ble født den 8 Sep 1599 i Jylland og døde den 26 Jan 1665 i Sandnes.)
2 CONT
2 CONT g. og æ. i Høyland,  s. 171, nr. 9
2 CONT
2 CONT http://web.archive.org/web/20080622233550/http://www.nose.dk/Norge/trane.html#16
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Elisabeth Christensdotter Thrane b. 1613, Stavanger, Rogaland,
2 CONT  Norway, m. 1630, Soeren Pedersson Godtzen, b. 8 Sep 1599, Jylland,
2 CONT  Denmark, d. 26 Jan 1665, Stavanger, Rogaland, Norway.  Elisabeth died
2 CONT  16 Oct 1684, Stavanger, Rogaland, Norway.  Soeren: From Oct 16. 1638
2 CONT  he was Major of Stavanger. He also was active in trading and shipping.
2 CONT  In 1649 and 1660 it is said that he owned 1 larger and 1 smaller ship.
2 CONT  He owned severeal sites and farms in Stavanger and surroundings. In
2 CONT  1657, his properties was estimated to 2000 rdl, his business
2 CONT  properties to 2000 rdl, and the interest to 200 rdl, all together 4200 rdl.
2 CONT  This corresponds to the value of 1400 cows of good quality. The esqutcheon
2 CONT  of the Godtzen family was a flower divided in three parts on the helmet, and 
2 CONT  a hand holding a skull. In the cathedral of Stavanger, there is a painting of
2 CONT  Major Godtzen and his family. Two of their children, which died very young, 
2 CONT  is painted with wings of angels.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Tranernes Vaaben''' var: En forgylt Trane holdende en Kugle i Grønt Feldt og paa Hjelmen enten en forgvldt Trane eller en saadan Figur. Elisabeth Tranes Valgsprog var: Gud,ære og dyd er al min Fryd 
2 CONT
