2 CONT Jens Søfrensen Godtzen|f. 5 apr. 1637\nd. 29 jun. 1713|p164.htm#i6789|Søfren Pedersen Godtzen|f. 8 sep. 1599\nd. 26 jan. 1665|p295.htm#i12012|Elisabeth Christensdatter Trane|f. 1613\nd. 26 okt. 1684|p295.htm#i12013|||||||Christen 
2 CONC C. Trane|f. c 1575\nd. 9 mai 1644|p162.htm#i6720|Anne Jensdatter|d. e 1645|p162.htm#i6721|
