1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Anna May Kielland (Harris)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/179205034/anna_may-kielland
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Marvin Benjamin Harris and Jinnet Lyell, she married Sören Theodor Munch Bull Kielland, a Norwegian Vice Counsel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Rolf Harris Munch, b. 1884, d. 1959, m. Mildred Elizabeth "Millie" Howell
2 CONT 2. Jinnet Christine, b. 1886, d. 1963, m. Dr. Edward Pliny Seaver, Jr., M.D.
2 CONT 3. Dorothea Elizabeth, b. 1889, d. ????
2 CONT 4. Caspar Marvin, b. 1892, d. 1918 in France, U.S. Army, WWI
2 CONT 5. Anns Harris, b. 1896, d. 1948, m. Donald Hagen
